ily: Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .box-content p {\n        margin: 0;\n        font-size: 15px;\n        text-align: justify;\n    }\n    .handwritten-flow {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        font-size: 16px;\n        margin-bottom: 25px;\n    }\n    .flow-root {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        margin-right: 10px;\n    }\n    .flow-branches {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 8px;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n        border: 2px dashed #bbb;\n        background-color: #f5f5f5;\n        color: #777;\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 160px;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n    }\n    .main-title {\n        font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n        font-size: 26px;\n        margin-top: 0;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n        color: #000;\n    }\n    .main-text p {\n        font-size: 16px;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n        text-align: justify;\n    }\n    .text-indent {\n        text-indent: 2em;\n    }\n    strong {\n        font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n        font-weight: normal;\n    }\n    u {\n        text-decoration-color: #000;\n        text-underline-offset: 4px;\n    }\n    .wavy-underline {\n        text-decoration-line: underline;\n        text-decoration-style: wavy;\n        text-underline-offset: 4px;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page-container\">\n    <div class=\"left-column\">\n        <div class=\"handwritten-notes handwritten\">\n            <h2>佛教的创立</h2>\n            <p>背景：种姓制度激化了社会矛盾。</p>\n            <p class=\"indent-text\">反对婆罗门特权的情绪</p>\n            <p class=\"indent-text\">高涨</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"sidebar-box\">\n            <div class=\"box-header\">\n                <span class=\"icon\">?</span> 问题思考\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"box-content\">\n                <p>古代印度的佛像艺术对中国产生了很大影响。你能说出深受印度佛像艺术影响的中国古代石窟吗？</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"handwritten-flow handwritten\">\n            <div class=\"flow-root\">印度</div>\n            <div class=\"flow-branches\">\n                <div>=&gt; 中亚 =&gt; 中国 =&gt; 朝鲜、日本、越南</div>\n                <div>=&gt; 斯里兰卡 =&gt; 缅甸、泰国、柬埔寨</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"sidebar-box\">\n            <div class=\"box-header\">\n                <span class=\"icon\">👤</span> 人物扫描\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"box-content\">\n                <p>乔达摩·悉达多是印度北部迦毗罗卫城③释迦族的王子。据说，他看到走投无路的老人、[?]不堪的病人、暴露于荒郊</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">\n            [Picture: partial view of a statue/animal]\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-column\">\n        <h1 class=\"main-title\">释迦牟尼创立佛教</h1>\n        \n        <div class=\"main-text\">\n            <p><strong>时间：</strong>佛教创立于公元前6世纪。<span class=\"handwritten\">创始人：</span>乔达摩·悉达多，后来被称为“<span class=\"wavy-underline\">释迦牟尼</span>”。</p>\n            \n            <p class=\"text-indent\"><u>早期佛教反对第一等级婆罗门的特权</u>，<u>提出“众生平等”</u>，<u>不拒绝低种姓的人入教</u>；<u>同时，佛教宣扬“忍耐顺从”</u>，<u>得到国王和一些富人的支持</u>。信仰佛教的民众日益增多，佛教一度成为印度最重要的宗教之一①。</p>\n            \n            <p><strong>传播：</strong><u>公元前3世纪后，佛教开始向外传播。</u>公元前1世纪，佛教经中亚传到中国新疆，再传入中国内地，后又传到朝鲜、日本和越南等国。佛教往南经锡兰②，传到缅甸、泰国、柬埔寨等国。</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
